ion  international aid is arriving but it  quickly becomes clear that it is still  not enough medics tell us people are  suffering from malaria water-borne  illnesses serious infections that  started as small wounds they admit  people need more help than they are able  to give  zayn basravi al-jazeera larkana sindh  pakistan
 

